<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities say a suspect in an Assad-era massacre was abducted from Lebanon while Damascus remains open to dialogue despite security concerns, and the Israeli Defense Forces continue to enforce a southern Syria buffer zone. Israeli incursions into southern provinces, including Quneitra and Daraa, are being condemned as they obstruct reconstruction and threaten stability, prompting protests after an explosion at a martyrs’ cemetery in Aleppo and a separate blast in Damascus during Macron’s visit. The Syrian Kurdish community is reported to prefer Bashar al-Assad over Erdogan, and the SDF repelled an armed group’s attempt to infiltrate Ain Issa. 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPS2JjWFgtb3diSHFwYXZ4SnFpdGNndXlsYjJPeDRXSUpoZXI1TkktdTdYQW1DZnBjVWhzZnhMLWhnWXNRX19uYnBmalhyX25HSUd6Z0J2WWRnZFluUFptMWlzbV9odXFaTTVPOXFweE9hRDdoTmhFMkhMVHJnVy01djNOdktQWkZGZ0QxaEFFQ211UDB1VGlEQ3ZIZnJIQXN6OHZjaXNzSzJzUVIwVjRjT0R2T01vczhK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFB4OGJVQ0g4bkt0QTNxSC1PWFVPclFEMzdCUzNEUlJIY1pjY1RSbl8xSkpGbFRUdGQ5b0lKZDhMLVBWdHpobGtLcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1xcHJRVGZKUWFhNzlWblVDaGVZWVhfVk9YeTVMUmEtTzhDdnpqSGw2ZGMzd2VQU3p1QUw2TWlvdXg4a3dVcDhzQ3IxSXV0MW5RelFBb3k2dmk2U1dH?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBfc3FfaE9vdXBvVWlIaFloVGdFeUhzaHFmbGc0ZlBVZ1YyOG5yTk8wb1hZd0JtNjhjclc0c0xpZng1NGx6cl8wakRmRkEyWk95NXpRSFk2YmVGdlVSd1VZQkRIRUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOSXJVV3VZb0JSQUZoX1NIRFpyNjhvVlRpcUIyY0ZMMW5yZDRWNU5VdFUzVG5h